    ─── Gaussian GT 标签实现 ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────

    新增函数：zwerge/src/zwerge_retrofit/dataset.py
      get_patch_gaussian_label_from_bbox(image_processor, image, bbox, sigma_factor=0.5)
        各向异性高斯：以 GT bbox 中心为均值，
          σ_x = bbox_width_px * sigma_factor
          σ_y = bbox_height_px * sigma_factor
